{icon:bullet,1.2}Gain {c_random}[Affix_Value_1*100|x%|]{/c} bonus Poisoning damage.
{icon:bullet,1.2}Direct damage from {c_important}Werewolf{/c} Skills gain a bonus equal to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 0"*100|x%|]{/c} of your bonus Poisoning damage, up to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 2"*100|x%|]{/c}.
{icon:bullet,1.2}Poison damage from Werewolf Skills gain a bonus equal to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 1"*100|x%|]{/c} of your bonus Attack Speed and Critical Strike Chance, up to {c_number}[Affix."Static Value 2"*100|x%|]{/c}. 

Current Direct Damage bonus: {c_number}[min((Owner.DOT_DPS_Bonus_Percent+Owner.DOT_DPS_Bonus_Percent_Per_Damage_Type#Poison)*Affix."Static Value 0"*100, Affix."Static Value 2" * 100)|%x|]{/c}
Current Poison Damage bonus: {c_number}[min((Owner.Attack_Speed_Percent_Bonus_Total+Owner.Cast_Speed_Percent_Bonus+Owner.Crit_Percent_Base+Owner.Crit_Percent_Bonus)*Affix."Static Value 1"*100, Affix."Static Value 2" * 100)|x%|]{/c}
